(5608382, 813158, 32011, '<td valign="top">Hey Hotpasta... this is the same homeless guy that''s in your Tunnel &amp; Caves photo  :)  ... though, if I''m wrong about that one being a hotpasta shot, then I''ll be wrong about this one too... guess I''ll have to wait and see when voting finished.<br/> <br/>But to this photo.  A great photo that doesn''t follow the DPC friendly template.  Details are excellent, but perhaps bordering on too much detail (especially the grime on the wall) and it becomes destracting.  And while the items in the bottom left help paint the picture/tell the story of homelessness, they''re also more a distraction that pull the viewer from the main subject.  Don''t get me wrong, *I* like this photo, but I''ll be surprised if it reaches the dizzy heights of most hostpasta challenge entries (score wise at least).</td>', 'Hey Hotpasta... this is the same homeless guy that''s in your Tunnel & Caves photo  :)  ... though, if I''m wrong about that one being a hotpasta shot, then I''ll be wrong about this one too... guess I''ll have to wait and see when voting finished. But to this photo.  A great photo that doesn''t follow the DPC friendly template.  Details are excellent, but perhaps bordering on too much detail (especially the grime on the wall) and it becomes destracting.  And while the items in the bottom left help paint the picture/tell the story of homelessness, they''re also more a distraction that pull the viewer from the main subject.  Don''t get me wrong, *I* like this photo, but I''ll be surprised if it reaches the dizzy heights of most hostpasta challenge entries (score wise at least).', '2009-08-12 01:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
