(5608415, 812585, 99981, '<td valign="top">Hey...i may be wrong but i think i saw this shot in a portfolio!<br/>Anyway, i really like her expression, the light and the position of the girl gave a nice touch to the composition. I just don''t understand the mud on her face.<br/>I think you should take the shot out of the portfolio, some people can judge you here by your other works. Geez, i just can''t remember if i saw this before or not. hahaha! Anyway, good work!</td>', 'Hey...i may be wrong but i think i saw this shot in a portfolio!Anyway, i really like her expression, the light and the position of the girl gave a nice touch to the composition. I just don''t understand the mud on her face.I think you should take the shot out of the portfolio, some people can judge you here by your other works. Geez, i just can''t remember if i saw this before or not. hahaha! Anyway, good work!', '2009-08-12 01:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
