(5612859, 813113, 83313, '<td valign="top">This seems soft and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 63k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Compression kills detail. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.</td>', 'This seems soft and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 63k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Compression kills detail. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.', '2009-08-16 00:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5612861, 812921, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll be very interested to learn how you accomplished this sort of coloration within basic editing rules.</td>', 'I''ll be very interested to learn how you accomplished this sort of coloration within basic editing rules.', '2009-08-16 00:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
