(5612960, 813036, 99506, '<td valign="top">Love the idea and the shot.<br/>I don''t know if it''s my monitor, it shouldn''t be as it''s just been calibrated, but I can see a great deal of greenish noise on the hand.<br/> <br/>Ok just to check I grabbed the image and when I open it in PS or simply just view it the image is fine so it has to be something to do with safari<br/> <br/>I''ve just tried resaving your file using save for web and set to Progressive in place of Optimized and/or embeded colour and now it seems fine in Safari...</td>', 'Love the idea and the shot.I don''t know if it''s my monitor, it shouldn''t be as it''s just been calibrated, but I can see a great deal of greenish noise on the hand. Ok just to check I grabbed the image and when I open it in PS or simply just view it the image is fine so it has to be something to do with safari I''ve just tried resaving your file using save for web and set to Progressive in place of Optimized and/or embeded colour and now it seems fine in Safari...', '2009-08-16 05:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
