(5615717, 813007, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well, bound to be a winner with the DPC crowd. This is a very literal concept but it is well shot and edited - and of course, simple. <br/> <br/>I''d like to have seen a bit more DOF so that all the petals were totally crisp as the blur does not add an evocative mood for me and the crisp edges are very appealing.</td>', 'Well, bound to be a winner with the DPC crowd. This is a very literal concept but it is well shot and edited - and of course, simple.  I''d like to have seen a bit more DOF so that all the petals were totally crisp as the blur does not add an evocative mood for me and the crisp edges are very appealing.', '2009-08-18 20:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
