(5616094, 813259, 107410, '<td valign="top">Wow, I must say that I''m extremely disappointed with this finish. I thought the creativity would''ve at least got me a 5, but clearly the obvious choice was the better one in this case. <br/> <br/>I REALLY feel that there should be a requirement to leave a comment with a score of a 3 or worse. I want to give a big thank you to those 37 of you that thought it really sucked, but didn''t let me know why.</td>', 'Wow, I must say that I''m extremely disappointed with this finish. I thought the creativity would''ve at least got me a 5, but clearly the obvious choice was the better one in this case.  I REALLY feel that there should be a requirement to leave a comment with a score of a 3 or worse. I want to give a big thank you to those 37 of you that thought it really sucked, but didn''t let me know why.', '2009-08-19 01:28:46.000000', NULL, 0),
